  "headline": "Listyo Sigit Required To Attend Ethics Trial In Person On Thursday",
  "seoTitle": "Listyo Sigit Investigation Wiretapping Allegations",
  "metaDescription": "Former Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo must appear in person at his ethics hearing regarding alleged illegal wiretapping and treason against the President.",
  "aiSummaryBullets": [
    "Former National Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo is required to attend his ethics trial in person on November 26, 2026.",
    "The ethics hearing concerns allegations of illegal wiretapping and treason directed toward President Prabowo Subianto.",
    "A panel of five three-star generals led by Commissioner General Hendro Pandowo will oversee the proceedings against Listyo Sigit."
  ],
  "aiContextParagraph": "The Indonesian National Police (Polri) has scheduled a Professional Code of Ethics Commission (KKEP) hearing for former Police Chief Listyo Sigit Prabowo on November 26, 2026. The proceedings follow allegations involving illegal wiretapping and treason charges linked to President Prabowo Subianto. Officials have confirmed that no special treatment will be granted, mandating Listyo Sigit's direct presence at the trial. The panel presiding over the case will consist of five three-star police generals, with Commissioner General Hendro Pandowo serving as the head. Separately, the police have scheduled an ethics hearing for Inspector General Slamet Uliandi, which is to be held on November 25, 2026, under the leadership of Commissioner General Rudi Darmoko. These hearings are part of a broader internal investigation by the National Police into serious misconduct allegations involving high-ranking officials.",
